.DS_Store
# Excel's lock file, created whenever materials-list.xlsx is open.
~$*
!.claude
__pycache__
.playwright-mcp
# cad-out/ is generated by `python3 -m cad`. The small stable text outputs and the STL
# are TRACKED: they are the evidence the kernel agreed at this rev, they diff usefully,
# and the builder opens the STL. The STEP files (~3.9 MB a run) and the diagnostic SVGs
# are not — regenerate them in 2.5 s instead of carrying them in history.
cad-out/*
!cad-out/REPORT.md
!cad-out/clash.txt
!cad-out/fasteners.txt
!cad-out/loft.txt
!cad-out/section.txt
!cad-out/model.stl
.kernel-cache

# playwright-mcp screenshots and page dumps — review artefacts, never inputs
.playwright-mcp/
